# corpus/destroy-failures
profile own
failure body typed Body
scope.begin first
new a A
new b B
on.destroy b 'alias self_alias self' 'use self_alias' 'fail typed Cleanup'
alias b_alias b
scope.end first
catch Cleanup caught
check BA
check BA
reset.log
scope.begin second
new a2 A
on.destroy a2 'fail typed Cleanup'
new b2 B
on.destroy b2 'fail typed Cleanup'
scope.unwind second body
catch Body caught_body
emit p
check BAp
assert.failure Body Cleanup Cleanup
reset.log
scope.begin third
new a3 A
on.destroy a3 'fail typed Cleanup'
defer third fail typed Body
scope.end third
catch Body caught_defer
emit d
check Ad
